{"id":802476,"title":"01｜从LangChain了解RAG","content":"关于RAG（Retrieval-Augmented Generation）的实践优化策略，LangChain出品了一系列详细的教程和资源。这些资源包括从零开始构建RAG系统的步骤、Query Translation、HyDE文档召回方法以及Query Construction等。针对不同类型的数据库如关系型数据库、GraphDB（例如Neo4j）或向量化数据库，可以设置不同的路由规则来进行查询分流。此外，还介绍了Chunk优化技术，如多级表示生成摘要、个性化Embeddings及使用Fine-tuning或ColBERT提高相似度计算效率。为了进一步提升检索效果，引入了诸如RAPTOR的聚类方法，并通过Ranking、Re-Ranking或CRAG进行结果校验。自适应RAG根据问题复杂性选择合适的处理方式；LangGraph则将工具节点间的关系建模为图结构，实现更灵活的任务执行流程。其他关键技术还包括Self-RAG与RRR用于错误纠正、多表示索引增强检索能力、ColBERT token级检索以提高精度、RAG融合策略将问题分解并重组以获得最佳答案组合。最后，通过回退机制确保前后问题间的连贯性，同时利用假设文档转换QD匹配为DD匹配来扩大搜索范围。整体设计上，首先对问题进行Embedding处理后存储于Vectorstore中，随后对文档进行切分并计算chunk embeddings，最终结合上下文生成响应。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":393616,"user_name":"苏果果","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":2852467,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"12A62ED032F345","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/2b/86/73/5190bbde.jpg","comment_is_top":true,"comment_ctime":1724323320,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":3,"race_medal":1,"score":2,"product_id":100799801,"comment_content":"各位同学，课程不提供PPT资料，特此声明～","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1008554,"avatar":"https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTJswWVKJTzFhgr9yBpy6ibr5OjFqSesDW7GDAmSNPibSiabwriacDXFpGuQ7t9W0R69egmqj5yJugBZTg/132","nickname":"不能飞的肥燕","note":"","ucode":"40962D20DAFD55","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":663695,"discussion_content":"一年了，可以有ppt了吗","content_length":12,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1749687855,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"上海","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]},{"author":{"id":2387555,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/24/6e/63/44666cb1.jpg","nickname":"妄","not